 organizing for both me and the kids) and I needed them much wider than the 2\u201d vertical containers I was using. \n\nThose would be able to hold one, maybe two books - nothing more \ud83d\ude15\n\nThis works so much better for us, and while it might not be as beige or clear as someone else\u2019s homeschool setup - it works \ud83d\udc4f. And that\u2019s the real goal in home organization, am I right? \n\nSkip what everyone else thinks would or should work. Measure your workbooks (or items!) and find containers that fit around the measurements you need. \n\n#homeorganizer #organized #homeschool #homeschoolroom #organizedhouse", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T00:35:15.000Z", "videoDuration": 20.641000747680664, "videoPlayCount": 5356, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 105, "commentsCount": 93, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/743967210_18419184082178865_5033614684946361911_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=MzkzNzgwNjg4NzYxNzExODA0MDE4NDE5MTg0MDc2MTc4ODY1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=iQrya6UYaKcQ7kNvwFFLHjZ&_nc_oc=AdoTK_gogO9enEr7Z176coF9k75_douDLGzIpEpY_06X6cKkJuxosDB8jL7SAMUJLQ4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=GU19o1fUT1qK7EXJdAvqCw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQCP_qZkNYaGfPPRTsQHEdb9VY6RIdelAZBDDywJC5eWQw&oe=6A6BDD3B", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMshcIV0Nw-0Lc_9KJD-ieWc4PxL2xwrveRHvZt9YlyfaIy6IcIkzPsaoRaZd3Zx2IlTHx3dGtaQzAta5wuBcm00d790kSP_kyBcuQ.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=Z5fHqBbjRAQQ7kNvwFmX9xl&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTAyNTU0NDM2MzU1NzI0NSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE2LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MjAsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=491e6a9619358bc1&_nc_&_nc_gid=GU